sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend API
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant AI as AI Fallback Wrapper
    participant G as Gemini
    participant H as Hugging Face
    participant DB as SQLite DB

    U->>F: Enter chat prompt
    F->>A: Verify token/session
    A-->>F: Auth success

    F->>B: POST /api/chat
    B->>DB: Load session/user data
    DB-->>B: Session info

    B->>AI: Generate response
    AI->>G: Try Gemini
    alt Gemini success
        G-->>AI: Response
    else Gemini fails
        AI->>H: Try Hugging Face fallback
        alt Fallback success
            H-->>AI: Response
        else Fallback fails
            H-->>AI: Error
        end
    end

    AI-->>B: Final AI response or error
    B->>DB: Save chat message
    DB-->>B: Saved
    B-->>F: JSON response
    F-->>U: Show answer